1
00:00:01,981 --> 00:00:06,784
Sign-in — the API key path

2
00:00:06,934 --> 00:00:10,746
Pasting a key is the fallback; expanding it focuses the field

3
00:00:10,896 --> 00:00:18,671
The key is validated against Render before it's stored, and only ever in the Keychain

4
00:00:18,821 --> 00:00:22,633
The service list — every service in the active workspace

5
00:00:22,783 --> 00:00:30,557
Scope is a workspace and, inside it, a project — every tab agrees about it

6
00:00:30,707 --> 00:00:38,482
Search narrows it down

7
00:00:38,632 --> 00:00:42,444
Service detail: current deploy first, then the configuration facts worth knowing on call

8
00:00:42,594 --> 00:00:54,330
The action set is computed per service — this one can deploy, restart, suspend, scale

9
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:57,302
Below the configuration, the drill-downs

10
00:00:57,452 --> 00:01:01,264
Deploy history, newest first, paging as you scroll

11
00:01:01,414 --> 00:01:11,170
One deploy: status, trigger, timing, and the commit that shipped

12
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:17,113
Metrics, charted against the plan's limits

13
00:01:17,263 --> 00:01:26,028
Same charts over 24 hours

14
00:01:26,178 --> 00:01:31,971
Chart set is chosen per service type

15
00:01:32,121 --> 00:01:39,896
Events: what Render did to this service, and when

16
00:01:40,046 --> 00:01:45,839
Logs, newest first, severity down the left edge

17
00:01:45,989 --> 00:01:59,707
Filtering is server-side, and the vocabulary comes from what this service actually emits

18
00:01:59,857 --> 00:02:13,575
A live tail over a WebSocket — lines arrive as they happen

19
00:02:13,725 --> 00:02:19,518
Environment variables — masked by default, because this screen gets shown in standups

20
00:02:19,668 --> 00:02:24,471
Revealing is per value, and resets the moment you navigate away

21
00:02:24,621 --> 00:02:35,367
Edits happen in a sheet with an explicit Save — nothing saves as you type

22
00:02:35,517 --> 00:02:43,291
Secret files, mounted into the service at build and run time — masked on the same rule

23
00:02:43,441 --> 00:02:52,206
What this service inherits from a group, which its own variable list deliberately omits

24
00:02:52,356 --> 00:03:04,093
Custom domains, with the verification state Render reports for each

25
00:03:04,243 --> 00:03:22,913
Which drill-downs exist depends on the service type

26
00:03:23,063 --> 00:03:27,866
A static site has two the web service didn't: it sits behind Render's CDN

27
00:03:28,016 --> 00:03:35,790
Redirects and rewrites, in the priority order Render evaluates them

28
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:44,705
Response headers, each scoped to a path pattern

29
00:03:44,855 --> 00:04:01,545
And the domains it answers on

30
00:04:01,695 --> 00:04:06,498
Every managed database in the workspace, with the plan and the version each is actually on

31
00:04:06,648 --> 00:04:12,441
Status, then the configuration, then the connection strings — masked, like every secret

32
00:04:12,591 --> 00:04:21,356
Suspend and resume live in the toolbar menu, each behind a confirmation

33
00:04:21,506 --> 00:04:30,271
Postgres metrics: the charts Render collects for this kind of instance

34
00:04:30,421 --> 00:04:46,120
And its logs, on the same screen the services use

35
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:50,082
The same screen for Key Value: Valkey version, eviction policy, persistence

36
00:04:50,232 --> 00:04:56,025
Status, then the configuration, then the connection strings — masked, like every secret

37
00:04:56,175 --> 00:05:05,931
Suspend and resume live in the toolbar menu, each behind a confirmation

38
00:05:06,081 --> 00:05:14,846
Key Value metrics: the charts Render collects for this kind of instance

39
00:05:14,996 --> 00:05:30,695
And its logs, on the same screen the services use

40
00:05:30,845 --> 00:05:35,647
Env groups belong to the workspace, not to a project or a service

41
00:05:35,797 --> 00:05:40,600
A group is variables, files, and the services they reach

42
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:48,525
The variables, masked on the same rule as a service's own

43
00:05:48,675 --> 00:05:55,458
And its secret files

44
00:05:55,608 --> 00:06:06,354
Linking a service here is the same edit as linking a group from the service side

45
00:06:06,504 --> 00:06:11,307
Signing out drops the credential from the Keychain

46
00:06:11,457 --> 00:06:16,410
Back to the list

